  <main id="main">

    <header class="phero" aria-label="Nos activités">
      <img class="phero__bg" src="/assets/img/sc/cross-groupe.webp" alt="Un groupe en plein circuit dans la salle" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
      <div class="phero__spot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1 class="display">Nos activités</h1>
        <p class="lead">Boxe, entraînement et préparation physique : choisissez ce qui vous correspond.</p>
        <p class="phero__note">Vous débutez ? Aucun problème. Dites-le au coach du créneau, il vous prend en charge. Les gants sont prêtés.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section" aria-label="Les cours encadrés">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Les cours encadrés</span>
        <div class="arows">
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="g">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/anglaise.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">01</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Boxe Anglaise</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Les bases, la technique, et on progresse à son rythme.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">Loisir et compétition</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="d">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/thai.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">02</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Boxe Thaï / K1</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Pieds et poings. La discipline la plus complète de la salle.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">Loisir et compétition</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="x">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/k1-coup-pied.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">03</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Kick Boxing</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Poings et jambes, sur un rythme soutenu.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">Tous niveaux</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="d">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/k1-duo.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">04</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Open Sparring</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Mettre les gants dans un cadre encadré, quand on se sent prêt.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">Sur créneau dédié</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="g">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/anglaise-header.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">05</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">PAOS</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Le travail aux pattes d’ours : précision, vitesse, coordination.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">Cours collectif</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="d">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/lady.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">06</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Boxing Lady</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Des séances entre femmes, sans opposition.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">100 % féminin</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="x">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/educative.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">07</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Baby Boxe</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">La découverte de la boxe pour les plus jeunes.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">Le samedi</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="d">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/tous-niveaux.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">08</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Boxe éducative</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Enfants, ados, et un créneau pour ceux qui visent la compétition.</p>
            <span class="arow__tag">Mercredi et samedi</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="arow" data-act data-dir="g">
          <figure class="ph ph--3x2 arow__ph">
            <img src="/assets/img/sc/cross-groupe.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="arow__txt">
            <span class="arow__n">09</span>
            <h3 class="arow__t">Boxing Camp</h3>
            <p class="arow__d">Boxe et condition physique dans la même séance.</p>
